message: If you use this software or these result files, please cite them as below.
title: "fsbench: exhaustive feature subset references and a leak-free benchmark of binary metaheuristics"
abstract: >-
  Exhaustively computed error tables over every non-empty feature subset of 12
  public datasets, and a pre-specified benchmark of nine binary metaheuristic
  variants against three controls under leak-free and leaky evaluation
  protocols.
